And you --

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:09.609
You actually, like, maybe almost
threw up on live television.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is that possible?
-Okay.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:12.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let me explain.
-Okay.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:15.448
-Okay, I didn't know I had a
problem with blood like that.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.450 line:92%
-Oh, you found out on live TV.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.084 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I found out.

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, during the rehearsals,
I was just like, "Mm."

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.123 size:88% position:44%
You know, 'cause I watch
a lot of bloody stuff,

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:23.957 line:92%
so I'm like, "Oh, I'll be --"

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:27.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
And all of a sudden,
like -- "Mm. Mm, that's -- Mm.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ooh, that's making me feel
kind of mm, some kind of way."

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I'm like,
"Mm. I can do it."

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Kenan was like,
"Are you gonna be okay?"

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Oh! Mm, I'm fine.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
As long as it
don't get on me and stuff,

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:40.607 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I think I'll be okay."

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:42.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
James is evil.
-Yeah.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:44.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
