and it went right into my mouth.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here's a good shot
at exactly how much --

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.657 size:81% position:41%
