exactly what happened.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.191 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let me tell you,
it went into my mouth.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
I immediately threw up
