to throw up on live TV.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.770 line:92%
You are not gonna do that!

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
Swallow it!
Swallow it!"

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:19.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I was like,
"Ugh! Ugh! Aah, aah, aah!"

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:22.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that's
this moment right there.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
